Facts that drift over time live in the `set` tags right below. The text that
chatbot.vto shares lives in the partials that both of them include.

Whitespace discipline, since the output is not post-processed: an optional
block starts with a blank line and ends without one, so that the fixed text
around it reads the same whether or not the block is emitted.
